OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer tells rape trial he
OL,4,Adid not commit sex crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer accused of rape in
OL,7,FShetland has told a court he did not
OL,8,Fcommit the crimes he is accused of.
OL,10,FCarmichael John Williamson - known as
OL,11,FJohn Williamson - is on trial at the
OL,12,FHigh Court in Edinburgh.
OL,14,FHe is accused of assaulting and raping
OL,15,Fa teenage girl in 2014 and 2015, and of
OL,16,Fhaving sexual activity with the girl
OL,17,Fwhen she was under age. It is also
OL,18,Falleged he raped a woman in 2022 while
OL,19,Fshe was intoxicated and unable to
OL,20,Fconsent.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
